Hi,

The problem was that the virtual memory soft limit was not high enough.

BEFORE
=======
ksh> ulimit -Hv   <-- Virtual Memory Hard Limit
6290784
ksh> ulimit -Sv   <-- Virtual Memory Soft Limit
1048576

After increasing virtual memory soft limit to 6GB ("ksh> ulimit -Sv
6290784") the program works properly.

Best regards, Domingo.

